{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1131356-we-re-now-a-brood","id":1131356,"title":"\"We're now a Brood!\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-19T10:53:16-07:00","id":1131356,"title":"\"We're now a Brood!\"","content":"So, having just experienced a situation where I realized I didn't really know how to fluff creating a Brood, (luckily I still have a bit time for that) so I wanted to turn to my trusty fellow forum goers a few questions:<br /> <br /> How did your Broods come about?<br /> Did you play the creation out IC, or was it more of an OOC decision? How many of you started play without a Brood, creating one during the game?<br /> Did you connect your hearts? If so, why? If not, why not?<br /> <br /> This is mostly meant as a place to simply share Brood related experiences, to take a look at how other people do things, and to hopefully take some inspirations away.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8542-wormwood","name":"Wormwood","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8542_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-19T11:49:05-07:00","id":1131369,"title":"","content":"Let's see.<br /> <br /> One I made up on my own was a powerful Beast setting out to create a Brood in order to have the power to control the place. So, he look out for Beast and more or less persuaded them to join.<br /> <br /> When it comes to actual games, I have a couple of examples.<br /> <br /> In my playtest back when the Kickstarter happened, we went for the classic &quot;enemies are hunting some of you, you all happen to be around&quot;, which is a bit of a clich\u00e9 when it comes to forming a party. There was no time to really delve into the the decision of connecting Lairs, it was just us trying out the game.<br /> <br /> Another short chronicle was about the character all being student in a boarding school. It was a little on the sandbox side of things, and some of the players decided for their characters to be more independent but, formally or not, they were a group of Beast arguing, fighting and working with each other, so they were Family after all. Some connected their Hearts, mostly for a matter of practicality.<br /> <br /> Another group, another short game. Here the players embraced the idea of Brood completely. A couple made their Beasts brother and sister, some created characters in a relationship with another and overall they all decided to play with the concept of Family. Here we started the game with the Brood already existing and all their Lairs connected<br /> <br /> So, far these are my experiences- Hope those help!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 08-19-2017, 06:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}